OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fmostly dry through this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight with some evening sunshine
OL,8,Fand then clear spells, becoming quite
OL,9,Fchilly in sheltered glens. Cloudier in
OL,10,Fthe west.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FDry with some bright or sunny
OL,13,Fspells in the east. Mostly cloudy with
OL,14,Fthe odd light shower in the west.
OL,15,FChance of more persistent rain in the
OL,16,Fwest late evening.
OL,17,
OL,18,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FAn
OL,19,Funsettled and changeable period, often
OL,20,Fcloudy with rain or showers, the rain
OL,21,Flikely heavy at times in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
